<title>ITALY: Alitalia, Finnair in code sharing deal.</title>
<headline>Alitalia, Finnair in code sharing deal.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian state carrier Alitalia said on Thursday it had signed a code sharing deal with Finnish airline Finnair.</p>
<p>As part of the deal, the companies will operate two shared flights a day from Milan's Linate airport to Stockholm and vice-versa from October 27. -- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
